      "title": "Checkout reserves the items before it charges the card",
      "narrative": "When a shopper presses Pay, Place order in Checkout API sends the order's items to Reserve route, POST /reservations on the Stock API of Inventory service, and waits for the answer. It charges the card only after Reserve route answers that the items are reserved.",
