    {
      "title": "A cancelled order puts its items back",
      "narrative": "Release route, DELETE /reservations/{order}, puts a cancelled order's items back through Reservation ledger. Its only caller is Timeout guard, which cancels an order still running after 10 seconds. Nothing else gives reserved items back, so an order that Timeout guard does not cancel keeps its items set aside.",
