    {
      "title": "The counts come from the warehouse",
      "narrative": "Every 5 minutes, Warehouse sync reads the counts from Warehouse system and sets each product's count in Stock DB to what the warehouse reports. It is the only part that writes the counts. Reservations are stored beside the counts and subtracted from them when the ledger checks an order, so a sync replaces the counts but never touches a reservation.",
